# PGA TOUR
## General PGA Tour

### What Is the PGA TOUR?
The PGA TOUR co-sanctions tournaments on the PGA TOUR, PGA TOUR Champions, Korn Ferry Tour and PGA TOUR Americas, and administers PGA TOUR Q-School presented by Korn Ferry and PGA TOUR University. The modern-day PGA TOUR was formed in 1968 when a subset of touring professionals broke away from the PGA of America. By showcasing golf's greatest players, we engage, inspire and positively impact our fans, partners and communities worldwide. 

